op77_map3d
==========

Game data (web/data)
--------------------
world.glb, buildings.bin, roads.bin and manifest.json are generated by
tools/export_web.py from the game files of Cyberpunk 2077 (the game's 3D map
meshes, its building volume data and its traffic lane network).

